NMI values for categorical confounders:
\begin{table}
\toprule
Confounder & NMI \\
\midrule
patient & 0.544 \\
sample & 0.567 \\
source & 0.197 \\
cell\_type & 0.507 \\
cell\_subtype & 0.658 \\
cell\_cycle\_phase & 0.195 \\
\bottomrule
